      "statement": "Finance reported the nightly reconciliation output for 2026-01-15 was missing from the shared location, while files for every other date in January were present."
    },
    {
      "citations": [{"content_digest": "sha256:a06e31d65db9030a1839f4fb679e55f1953e2001ff6ed21483159329a2783d99", "evidence_id": "chat-2210"}],
      "statement": "The scheduler showed the 2026-01-15 reconciliation run completed successfully with exit status 0 at 02:14:00Z, relying solely on exit status without checking for output."
