      "statement": "Release 2.1.0 was deployed on 2026-01-14, replacing the CSV writer library, but the release record does not specify if the new writer signals failure by exit status."
    },
    {
      "citations": [{"content_digest": "sha256:2d857e1f8ad6a750aeb500570c666baa89920360cd5f464fa353d0f7cfd7ece2", "evidence_id": "ticket-1109"}],
      "statement": "INC-1101 remains open with no root cause established; the missing output was regenerated manually from a downstream copy on 2026-01-23."
    },
    {
      "citations": [{"content_digest": "sha256:47772f074f507f960c00a968289297fc257b37ca3b486af17a6ca82794b7491e", "evidence_id": "log-90001"}],
      "statement": "The reconciliation job for 2026-01-22 completed successfully, processing 412093 rows and writing one output file."
    }
  ],
